    "text": "At the bottom most point, square of speed of bob,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>–</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />It will rise further to a height,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>L</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>"
